<title>USA: Hartford Computer IPO postponed-underwriter.</title>
<headline>Hartford Computer IPO postponed-underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hartford Computer Group Inc's initial public offering has been postponed said underwriter Alex Brown &amp; Sons.</p>
<p>No reason was given for the postponment.</p>
<p>The deal was expected to price during the week of March 24.</p>
<p>Hartford Computer expected to price an estimated 3.5 million shares at a proposed price range of $14 to $16 per share.</p>
<p>Hartford Computer provides microcomputer products and related services.</p>
</text>
